{"id": "t063-001", "text": "Meera's daughter starts Year 1 on Monday. She's more nervous than the little one is, apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Year 1", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-002", "text": "Remind me to ask Connor how his daughter's first day at nursery went. It was this morning at 9.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Connor how his daughter's first day at nursery went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first day at nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning at 9", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-003", "text": "Laura and Ben are getting a puppy next Saturday, a cocker spaniel. They've already named him Biscuit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ben", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "puppy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cocker spaniel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t063-004", "text": "Spoke to Haruto on the phone. His cat Miso has been off her food for three days and he's taking her to the vet tomorrow at 10am. He sounded really worried.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Miso", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off her food", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three days", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "vet", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow at 10am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-005", "text": "Need to post the graduation card to Keisha before Friday. Her ceremony is next Wednesday at 2pm.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post the graduation card to Keisha", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ceremony", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-006", "text": "Picking up the dry cleaning tomorrow morning, then the big shop on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}]}
{"id": "t063-007", "text": "Eli passed his driving test! Third attempt, after failing the last one on a roundabout. He rang me straight from the test centre this morning and could barely get the words out. His girlfriend has already put him on the insurance for her car, so he's driving them to the coast next weekend. Send him a proper congratulations message tonight, and maybe some L-plate-free keyrings as a joke.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving them to the coast", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send him a proper congratulations message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "some L-plate-free keyrings", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t063-008", "text": "Yasmin's son has his GCSE results on Thursday. She said he's convinced he's failed maths, but his teacher thinks he'll be fine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSE results", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "teacher", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t063-009", "text": "Naledi wants to meet for lunch next Tuesday at half 12. I said yes, the place near her office.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday at half 12", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-010", "text": "Nadia's dog Pepper turns ten this weekend. She's doing a little party for her in the garden, which is very Nadia.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns ten", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t063-011", "text": "Luis mentioned his mum is moving in with them in a fortnight. He seems a bit overwhelmed by it all.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in with them", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit overwhelmed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
