{"id": "t063-016", "text": "Don't forget to send Rafael the photos from the christening. He asked twice now.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Rafael the photos from the christening", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t063-017", "text": "Dawit's little boy lost his first tooth this morning and is extremely proud of himself.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first tooth", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-018", "text": "Sam and his wife are flying to Lisbon on the 14th at 6am. Their neighbour is feeding the cats.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th at 6am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbour", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cats", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
