{"id": "t063-021", "text": "Aditi loves orchids. She has about fifteen on her kitchen windowsill.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "orchids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has about fifteen", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t063-022", "text": "Coffee with Jorge went well. He's training for the Manchester half marathon in April and has finally sorted his knee out after months of physio. He runs with a club on Tuesday and Thursday evenings now and does a long run on Sunday mornings. He's thinking about a full marathon next year if the half goes well. He also mentioned he's started baking sourdough, which I did not see coming.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Manchester half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "runs with a club", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday and Thursday evenings"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday mornings"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about a full marathon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next year"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "baking sourdough", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t063-023", "text": "Dana's rabbit, Clover, had an operation on Monday. She's recovering, but Dana is still keeping her indoors. Must text her tomorrow evening to see how Clover is doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rabbit, Clover", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t063-024", "text": "Uma is vegan now, has been since the summer. Worth remembering for the dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t063-025", "text": "Joy's niece is graduating from Edinburgh next Friday morning. Joy is driving up on Thursday night with her sister and coming back Sunday. Her niece did a degree in marine biology and has already been offered a research post in Aberdeen starting in January. Joy is so proud she showed me the photos from the offer email.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduating from Edinburgh", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday night", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "degree in marine biology", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "research post in Aberdeen", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-026", "text": "Santiago is coming to stay this weekend. He arrives Friday at about 8pm. I need to make up the spare room and buy some decent coffee before then.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at about 8pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "make up the spare room", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy some decent coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t063-027", "text": "Oisín said his granddad is in hospital again with his chest. Oisín is going over to see him on Saturday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "granddad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over to see him", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-028", "text": "Remind me to ring Yusuf on Thursday at lunchtime to see how his interview went. It's on Wednesday at 11.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Yusuf", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at lunchtime", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 11", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-029", "text": "Alana's daughter got into the grammar school! Alana cried telling me about it on the phone this evening. They found out this morning and apparently her daughter screamed so loudly the neighbours came round to check everything was alright. She starts in September and they're already panicking about the bus route. Send flowers or something this week, and maybe a little card for her daughter too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the grammar school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this evening"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbours", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "a little card for her daughter", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t063-030", "text": "Luca's new kitten is called Pasta. He sent me about forty photos this afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new kitten", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this afternoon"}]}
{"id": "t063-031", "text": "Had a long catch-up with Keisha. Her brother Eli is moving to Bristol next month for a new job at the university, and their mum is not handling it well at all. Keisha is going down with him on the 3rd to help with the move. She also mentioned she fancies doing a pottery course in the new year, maybe on Tuesday evenings.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the university", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not handling it well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fancies doing a pottery course", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday evenings"}]}
{"id": "t063-032", "text": "Haruto's son has his piano exam on Saturday at half 10. Grade 3. He's been practising every night after dinner and Haruto says the whole street now knows the pieces by heart. The poor kid is really nervous about the sight-reading part. Haruto and his wife are both taking him, then going for pancakes afterwards whatever happens.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "piano exam", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at half 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night after dinner"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-033", "text": "Must book the car in for its MOT before the end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the car in for its MOT", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the end of the month", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t063-034", "text": "Meera said Connor's dad isn't well. Probably best not to mention the barbecue to him for now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "now"}]}
{"id": "t063-035", "text": "Laura told me her parents' fortieth anniversary is on the 22nd. She and her sister are throwing them a surprise dinner on the Saturday after, at 7pm. I'm doing the cake. Need to ask Laura how many people are coming by next Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fortieth anniversary", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after, at 7pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Laura how many people are coming", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by next Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t063-036", "text": "Yasmin's cat, Mr Whiskers, went missing on Tuesday night. Still no sign of him. She's put posters up all over the estate and posted in every local Facebook group. Her kids are heartbroken and keep leaving his food bowl out by the back door. She's checking the vets and the shelter again tomorrow morning. I should ring her on Saturday and offer to help with a proper search of the allotments.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat, Mr Whiskers", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "heartbroken", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to help with a proper search of the allotments", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t063-037", "text": "Ben's starting his new job at the council on Monday morning. He's really nervous about the commute.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ben", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-038", "text": "Nadia and Luis are coming for dinner on Friday at 7.30. Nadia is allergic to nuts, so no pesto, and Luis doesn't eat mushrooms. They're bringing their little one, who goes to bed around 8, so they might leave early. Luis said they've got news to share, which I suspect is the new house. I need to buy a high chair cover and some wine on Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 7.30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to nuts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat mushrooms", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little one", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "goes to bed around 8", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new house", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a high chair cover and some wine", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t063-039", "text": "Zeynep's daughter had her first swimming lesson today and refused to get out of the pool at the end.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first swimming lesson", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-040", "text": "Text Khadija good luck before her OSCE exam on Monday morning. She is absolutely terrified of it.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Khadija good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "OSCE exam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-041", "text": "Nina's birthday is on the 9th. She keeps saying she needs a new yoga mat because hers is falling apart.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "needs a new yoga mat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t063-042", "text": "Got back from Milan and Dana's housewarming. Lovely flat. Their dog Toffee is enormous now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Toffee", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t063-043", "text": "Dr Patel said the results should be back by next Thursday. I'll ring the surgery on Friday morning if I haven't heard.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Patel", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday morning"}]}
{"id": "t063-044", "text": "Rafael's mum is turning seventy next Sunday. He's taking her to the coast for lunch. He said she's been hinting about a new reading lamp.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning seventy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hinting about a new reading lamp", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t063-045", "text": "Ask Dawit how his daughter's school play went. It was last night and she had a speaking part.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Dawit how his daughter's school play went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school play", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-046", "text": "Sam Hughes from the running club has a new puppy, a whippet called Dart. He's bringing her to the park on Sunday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam Hughes", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the running club", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "whippet called Dart", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning"}]}
{"id": "t063-047", "text": "The parents' evening on Thursday is cancelled because of the strike, so Jakub and I are going to the cinema instead.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jakub", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cinema", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t063-048", "text": "Elif rang. Her dad had a fall at the weekend and is in a cast for six weeks. She's going over every evening after work to help him. I should send her a meal voucher or drop something round on Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elif", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a cast", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a meal voucher", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop something round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t063-049", "text": "Aditi Kim is my new manager from Monday. She used to work at the BBC.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi Kim", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Monday"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "used to work at the BBC", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t063-050", "text": "Jorge's son is doing his A-levels this summer and wants to study veterinary medicine. Jorge is quietly very proud.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A-levels", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to study veterinary medicine", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-051", "text": "Uma and her husband are expecting their second in March! She told me at the school gates this morning. Don't forget to get something small for their eldest so she doesn't feel left out.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get something small for their eldest", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t063-052", "text": "Joy says her parrot, Captain, has learned to imitate the microwave. It goes off at 6am every day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "parrot, Captain", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6am every day"}]}
{"id": "t063-053", "text": "Need to organise the playdate with Santiago's kids. Maybe Saturday afternoon, or next Sunday if the weather's bad.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "organise the playdate with Santiago's kids", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playdate", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-054", "text": "Oisín (Osh to everyone at work) has his citizenship ceremony on Tuesday at 11am. Must remember to bring a card in on Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Osh", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "citizenship ceremony", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday at 11am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring a card in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
