{"id": "t063-056", "text": "Long call with Alana tonight. Her dog Juno was diagnosed with diabetes last week, so it's insulin injections twice a day now, morning and evening. Alana's finding it really hard to fit around work and the kids' swimming. Her husband is away until Thursday as well. I offered to walk Juno on Wednesday afternoon. Should check in with her again on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Juno", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "diagnosed with diabetes", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "morning and evening"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hard to fit around work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday afternoon"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t063-057", "text": "Luca and his partner are getting married in Sicily next June. Save the dates are coming out in a fortnight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Sicily", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight"}]}
